    "detailed_description": "Using the recoil of your guns, you shoot your way through claustrophobic saw blade filled levels. Turn lasers off, switch guns mid-level, and much more throughout 3 different biomes, each with their own new obstacles and levels to make a fun but rage-inducing experience!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n3 biomes filled with 10 levels + new and exciting obstacles and guns!<br />\r\nCute and cartoony pixel graphics!<br />\r\nJuicy and good-feeling gameplay throughout!<br />\r\n30 levels are getting harder and harder!",
